The product must demonstrate the complete cycle:

UNDERSTAND → DECIDE → ACT → VERIFY → MEASURE

The platform must be positioned as an AI teammate that completes business workflows, not just a chatbot, CRM, analytics dashboard or AI recommendation engine.

